WEBVTT

00:07.275 --> 00:08.517
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:08.620 --> 00:10.413
[kids] Aye-aye, Captain!
[孩子们] 是啊，队长！

00:10.517 --> 00:11.758
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:11.862 --> 00:14.068
[kids] Aye-aye, Captain!
[孩子们] 是啊，队长！

00:14.172 --> 00:16.758
♪ Oh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:16.862 --> 00:18.931
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.034 --> 00:20.827
[kids] ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[孩子们] ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:20.965 --> 00:23.103
[Painty] ♪ Absorbent,
and yellow, and porous is he ♪
[油漆] ♪ 吸收性，
黄色、多孔的是他 ♪

00:23.206 --> 00:24.724
[kids] ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[孩子们] ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:24.793 --> 00:26.931
[Painty] ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
[Painty] ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.068 --> 00:28.620
[kids] ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[孩子们] ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:28.724 --> 00:31.068
[Painty] ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
[Painty] ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.137 --> 00:32.931
-♪ SpongeBob SquarePants
-♪ Ready? ♪
-♪ 海绵宝宝
-♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:33.068 --> 00:34.965
[all] ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[全部] ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:35.068 --> 00:36.931
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:37.034 --> 00:38.862
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:38.931 --> 00:42.620
[Painty]
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
[油漆]
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:42.724 --> 00:45.137
[Painty laughing]
[佩蒂笑]

00:45.241 --> 00:47.103
-[flute playing]
-[song ends]
-[长笛演奏]
-[歌曲结束]

00:47.206 --> 00:49.275
-[waves lapping]
-[gulls squawking]
-[海浪拍打]
-[海鸥嘎嘎叫]

00:49.448 --> 00:51.965
[mysterious music playing]
【神秘音乐响起】

00:58.758 --> 00:59.689
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

01:00.103 --> 01:03.448
-[upbeat jazz music playing]
-[Squidward humming]
-[欢快的爵士乐演奏]
-[章鱼哥嗡嗡声]

01:03.931 --> 01:05.034
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:09.827 --> 01:11.655
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

01:12.103 --> 01:13.655
Perfect.
完美的。

01:16.068 --> 01:17.000
Woo.
呜。

01:17.517 --> 01:18.827
Evening, neighbor.
晚上好，邻居。

01:18.931 --> 01:20.965
Evening, Preston.
晚上好，普雷斯顿。

01:21.517 --> 01:24.172
[engine humming]
[发动机嗡嗡声]

01:24.275 --> 01:27.034
Good luck
at the concert tonight.
祝你好运
今晚的音乐会上。

01:27.172 --> 01:29.000
Thank you, Sebastian.
谢谢你，塞巴斯蒂安。

01:29.137 --> 01:31.103
[Squidward, VO]
You may think you know me,
[章鱼哥，画外音]
你可能认为你了解我，

01:31.172 --> 01:32.241
but you don't.
但你没有。

01:32.344 --> 01:35.310
I used to be
Squidward Tentacles,
我曾经是
章鱼哥的触手，

01:35.379 --> 01:36.586
but now, the name's...
但现在，这个名字是……

01:37.068 --> 01:39.551
Dolphin, John Dolphin.
海豚，约翰·海豚。

01:39.655 --> 01:43.827
[upbeat classical music playing]
【欢快的古典音乐演奏】

01:43.965 --> 01:45.068
It's John Dolphin!
这是约翰·海豚！

01:45.172 --> 01:47.310
[crowd clamoring excitedly]
[人群兴奋地叫嚷]

01:47.448 --> 01:48.482
[crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

01:48.620 --> 01:49.482
[triangle chimes]
[三角铃]

01:49.586 --> 01:51.862
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

01:51.965 --> 01:55.034
[Squidward, VO]
I have a wonderful new life
[章鱼哥，画外音]
我有美好的新生活

01:55.137 --> 01:56.965
in New Kelp City.
在新海带城。

01:57.379 --> 01:59.000
How did this happen?
这是怎么发生的？

01:59.103 --> 02:00.517
Well, I'll tell you.
好吧，我告诉你。

02:00.931 --> 02:04.551
One day, the worst thing
that ever happened to me
有一天，最糟糕的事情
这曾经发生在我身上

02:04.655 --> 02:05.896
turned out to be
原来是

02:06.000 --> 02:08.482
the best thing
that ever happened to me.
最好的事情
这曾经发生在我身上。

02:08.551 --> 02:10.206
[door opens, closes]
[门打开，关闭]

02:10.275 --> 02:12.862
Excuse me.
I'd like to lodge a complaint.
打扰一下。
我想投诉。

02:12.965 --> 02:15.068
This reed is defective.
这根簧片有缺陷。

02:15.172 --> 02:16.034
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

02:16.137 --> 02:18.758
[playing out of tune]
[演奏走调]

02:19.206 --> 02:20.586
[cracks, shatters]
[裂缝、破碎]

02:21.241 --> 02:22.034
[boing]
[嗡嗡声]

02:22.137 --> 02:25.068
[groans, coughs]
[呻吟，咳嗽]

02:26.586 --> 02:27.758
I'm sorry, sir,
对不起，先生，

02:27.862 --> 02:30.689
but that's the only reed
we have in stock.
但这是唯一的芦苇
我们有库存。

02:30.793 --> 02:33.241
Have you ever thought
of playing something safer,
你有没有想过
玩一些更安全的东西，

02:33.344 --> 02:35.034
like the triangle?
像三角形？

02:35.137 --> 02:36.862
-[eraser squeaking]
-[glass shatters]
-[橡皮擦吱吱声]
-[玻璃碎裂]

02:36.965 --> 02:38.758
-[rock music plays]
-This is a stickup.
-[摇滚音乐响起]
-这是一个粘贴。

02:38.896 --> 02:40.413
Give me all the dough
in the joint,
把所有的面团都给我
在联合处，

02:40.517 --> 02:42.379
or I'll rub you out.
不然我就把你擦掉。

02:42.517 --> 02:43.344
[squeak]
[吱]

02:43.413 --> 02:45.275
Elmer Eraser!
埃尔默橡皮擦！

02:45.724 --> 02:47.241
[chuckles]
[笑声]

02:47.724 --> 02:50.137
If either of you bozos squeal,
如果你们中的任何一个蠢货尖叫

02:50.241 --> 02:52.172
I'll track ya down
我会追踪你

02:52.275 --> 02:54.551
and rub you out.
并把你擦掉。

02:54.655 --> 02:56.758
[rock music continues]
[摇滚乐继续]

02:58.448 --> 03:00.068
I won't say a syllable.
我不会说一个音节。

03:00.827 --> 03:05.758
See that you don't,
or Elmer Eraser will find you.
看看你没有，
或者埃尔默橡皮擦会找到你。

03:05.862 --> 03:07.413
-[rock music ends]
-[indistinct chatter]
-[摇滚乐结束]
-[含糊不清的喋喋不休]

03:07.482 --> 03:09.620
[Squidward, VO] The police tried
to get me to talk,
[章鱼哥，画外音] 警方尝试过
让我说话，

03:09.758 --> 03:11.724
but I wasn't interested...
但我不感兴趣...

03:11.827 --> 03:13.137
at first.
起初。

03:13.931 --> 03:16.620
I told you,
I didn't see a thing.
我告诉过你，
我什么也没看到。

03:16.758 --> 03:18.482
Not to worry, Mr. Tentacles.
别担心，触手先生。

03:18.620 --> 03:20.172
If you do remember anything,
如果你还记得什么的话

03:20.310 --> 03:22.931
we can put you
into witness protection.
我们可以把你
纳入证人保护。

03:23.034 --> 03:25.793
Of course, we'll have
to move you to a new town,
当然，我们会有
把你搬到一个新的城镇，

03:25.862 --> 03:28.379
change your name,
and give you a new job.
改变你的名字，
并给你一份新工作。

03:28.482 --> 03:30.758
Look, officer, I'm not talking.
听着，警官，我不是在说话。

03:30.862 --> 03:34.724
Unfortunately, you'll never see
your friends or neighbors again.
不幸的是，你永远不会看到
再次你的朋友或邻居。

03:36.724 --> 03:38.241
I saw everything.
我看到了一切。

03:38.344 --> 03:40.103
I'll testify.
我会作证。

03:41.689 --> 03:43.724
[Squidward, VO]
Now, I have everything
[章鱼哥，画外音]
现在，我拥有了一切

03:43.827 --> 03:45.551
-I'd ever dreamed of.
-[crowd cheering]
-我曾经梦想过。
-[人群欢呼]

03:45.620 --> 03:46.896
[triangle chimes]
[三角铃]

03:46.965 --> 03:49.965
[crowd cheering and applauding]
[人群欢呼鼓掌]

03:50.103 --> 03:52.241
[Patrick giggling]
[帕特里克咯咯笑]

03:52.310 --> 03:53.827
Huh?
啊？

03:53.965 --> 03:55.517
[SpongeBob laughing]
[海绵宝宝大笑]

03:55.620 --> 03:58.689
I must be imagining things.
我一定是在想象一些事情。

03:59.482 --> 04:02.689
[crowd clamoring excitedly]
[人群兴奋地叫嚷]

04:02.793 --> 04:03.724
Huh?!
啊？！

04:04.206 --> 04:05.862
[SpongeBob and Patrick cheering]
[海绵宝宝和帕特里克欢呼]

04:05.965 --> 04:08.448
This can't be happening!
[exclaims]
这不可能发生！
[惊呼]

04:08.965 --> 04:11.103
-[thudding]
-[Squidward whimpers nervously]
-[重击]
-[章鱼哥紧张地呜咽]

04:11.517 --> 04:12.896
[whimpers nervously]
[紧张地呜咽]

04:13.482 --> 04:15.724
[together] We miss you,
Squidward.
[合]我们想念你
章鱼哥。

04:15.862 --> 04:17.965
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

04:18.068 --> 04:19.275
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

04:19.827 --> 04:22.517
[upbeat, comical music playing]
[播放欢快、滑稽的音乐]

04:24.482 --> 04:26.310
[together] Hi, Squidward.
[合]嗨，章鱼哥。

04:26.724 --> 04:27.896
-[crash]
-[tires screech]
-[崩溃]
-[轮胎尖叫声]

04:28.482 --> 04:29.862
[Squidward panting]
[章鱼哥气喘吁吁]

04:30.655 --> 04:33.758
-[crashing]
-[whimpering nervously]
-[崩溃]
-[紧张地呜咽]

04:35.482 --> 04:37.448
-[screech to a halt]
-[whimpers nervously]
-[尖叫着停了下来]
-[紧张地呜咽]

04:37.551 --> 04:39.275
[SpongeBob] Don't worry.
I've got it.
[海绵宝宝] 别担心。
我明白了。

04:39.379 --> 04:40.862
Love your new beard.
喜欢你的新胡子。

04:41.379 --> 04:43.517
Thanks, but it's only
a fake one. Huh?
谢谢，但这只是
一个假的。啊？

04:43.620 --> 04:45.655
SpongeBob and Patrick?!
海绵宝宝和帕特里克？！

04:45.724 --> 04:47.896
How did you two goofballs
find me?
你们两个混蛋怎么了
找到我吗？

04:48.034 --> 04:49.724
[SpongeBob, VO]
Oh, you like to know
[海绵宝宝，画外音]
哦，你想知道吗

04:49.862 --> 04:51.517
how we found you, Squidward?
我们是怎么找到你的，章鱼哥？

04:51.586 --> 04:54.758
Um, eh...
Where's your voice coming from?
嗯，呃...
你的声音从哪里来？

04:54.862 --> 04:56.172
[SpongeBob]
It was an average day
[海绵宝宝]
这是平凡的一天

04:56.275 --> 04:57.724
at the old Krusty Krab.
在老蟹堡。

04:57.827 --> 05:00.068
-But something was missing.
-[customers murmuring]
-但是缺少了一些东西。
-[顾客窃窃私语]

05:00.172 --> 05:03.241
Or should I say "someone"?
或者我应该说“某人”？

05:03.344 --> 05:04.862
Hello?
你好？

05:04.965 --> 05:06.793
-Anybody home?
-[thud]
-有人在家吗？
-[砰]

05:07.758 --> 05:08.827
Boy, the service here
兄弟，这里的服务

05:08.931 --> 05:11.965
is really going downhill,
SpongeBob.
真的是在走下坡路
海绵宝宝。

05:12.103 --> 05:15.034
Squidward's still not here?
I guess that would explain
章鱼哥还没来吗？
我想这可以解释

05:15.137 --> 05:17.241
why I haven't had a single order
in weeks.
为什么我没有一个订单
几周后。

05:17.310 --> 05:20.896
I haven't seen him in his house
for weeks either,
我没在他家里见过他
也有几周的时间，

05:20.965 --> 05:23.034
not even in his bathtub.
甚至在他的浴缸里也不行。

05:23.448 --> 05:25.689
And his fridge is out of food!
而且他的冰箱里没有食物了！

05:25.793 --> 05:28.586
I really miss
my favorite neighbor.
我真的很想念
我最喜欢的邻居。

05:28.689 --> 05:30.206
But I'm right here, buddy.
但我就在这里，伙计。

05:30.275 --> 05:31.689
Oh, thank goodness.
哦，谢天谢地。

05:31.758 --> 05:33.965
But how do we find Squidward?
但我们如何找到章鱼哥呢？

05:34.103 --> 05:36.068
Don't worry. I got this.
不用担心。我明白了。

05:36.689 --> 05:38.103
[stretch, pop]
[拉伸、弹出]

05:38.862 --> 05:39.793
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:39.931 --> 05:41.310
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

05:41.413 --> 05:45.586
Now, I just need something
that smells like Squidward.
现在，我只需要一些东西
闻起来像章鱼哥。

05:46.586 --> 05:48.689
One of his old clarinet reeds
should help.
他的一根旧单簧管簧片
应该有帮助。

05:48.758 --> 05:49.931
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

05:50.034 --> 05:51.448
Ew!
呃！

05:51.551 --> 05:54.103
[sniffing, barking] Got it!
[嗅嗅，吠叫]明白了！

05:54.241 --> 05:56.137
[panting, barking]
[气喘吁吁，吠叫]

05:56.241 --> 05:58.724
-[bowling pins clatter]
-[people groan]
-[保龄球瓶碰撞声]
-[人们呻吟]

05:58.793 --> 06:02.862
And so, we followed the scent
to your new front door.
于是我们循着气味
到你的新前门。

06:02.965 --> 06:04.551
Why did you leave us, Squidward?
你为什么离开我们，章鱼哥？

06:04.655 --> 06:07.827
[grumbles] You knuckleheads
are gonna ruin everything.
[抱怨]你们这些笨蛋
会毁了一切。

06:07.965 --> 06:10.344
I'm in witness protection.
我正在接受证人保护。

06:10.448 --> 06:12.344
Fitness infection?
健身感染？

06:12.482 --> 06:15.793
I'm hiding out
from Elmer Eraser.
我躲起来了
来自埃尔默橡皮擦。

06:15.862 --> 06:17.448
Elmer Eraser?!
埃尔默橡皮擦？！

06:17.517 --> 06:20.137
The robber who relishes
in rubbing out rats?
喜欢的强盗
消灭老鼠？

06:20.793 --> 06:22.310
-[Squidward grunts]
-[exclaiming]
-[章鱼哥咕哝]
-[惊呼]

06:22.379 --> 06:23.655
Would you two get lost?
你们两个会迷路吗？

06:23.724 --> 06:26.344
You're gonna lead that maniac
right to me.
你会带领那个疯子
对我来说是对的。

06:26.482 --> 06:27.517
[door slams]
[关门声]

06:27.655 --> 06:29.000
-Gee!
-[squeaks]
-哎呀！
-[吱吱声]

06:29.068 --> 06:32.551
I had no idea Squidward was
in witless perfection.
我不知道章鱼哥是
在无知的完美中。

06:32.655 --> 06:35.000
And we almost blew his cover.
我们差点就暴露了他的身份。

06:35.137 --> 06:35.965
[feet screech]
[脚尖叫]

06:36.034 --> 06:37.310
Hey, sorry about that.
嘿，对此感到抱歉。

06:37.413 --> 06:38.586
I didn't see ya there.
我在那儿没看到你。

06:38.655 --> 06:41.689
Say, that sure is a nice eraser.
说吧，这确实是一块很好的橡皮擦。

06:41.827 --> 06:44.586
Thanks. My mommy made it for me.
谢谢。我妈妈给我做的。

06:45.689 --> 06:47.931
Hmm. Eraser.
唔。橡皮。

06:48.034 --> 06:50.586
That reminds me of something,
but what?
这让我想起一件事
但什么？

06:51.172 --> 06:53.724
Do you bozos know
where I can find...
你们笨蛋知道吗
我在哪里可以找到...

06:54.172 --> 06:55.310
this mug?
这个杯子？

06:55.931 --> 06:56.931
[gasps]
[喘气]

06:57.034 --> 06:58.862
Elmer Eraser?
埃尔默橡皮擦？

06:58.965 --> 07:00.862
Oh, that's not a mug. That's--
哦，那不是杯子。那是——

07:00.931 --> 07:03.482
We've never seen that person
in our entire lives...
我们从未见过那个人
在我们的一生中...

07:03.586 --> 07:05.413
uh, with or without a beard.
呃，有或没有胡子。

07:05.862 --> 07:07.724
Well, if you do...
好吧，如果你这样做...

07:07.827 --> 07:09.310
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

07:10.172 --> 07:12.137
...please let me know.
...请告诉我。

07:13.448 --> 07:16.068
Patrick, that was Elmer Eraser.
帕特里克，那是埃尔默橡皮擦。

07:16.172 --> 07:16.965
Who?
WHO？
WHO？
WHO？

07:17.103 --> 07:18.758
We gotta warn Squidward.
我们得警告章鱼哥。

07:19.241 --> 07:22.896
Phew! Thank Neptune
those idiots are gone.
唷！评分此翻译： 感谢你的评分 不好 好
那些白痴已经走了。

07:23.000 --> 07:24.724
[together] Squidward!
[合]章鱼哥！

07:25.448 --> 07:26.344
[birds chirping]
[鸟鸣声]

07:26.448 --> 07:27.586
And they're back.
他们回来了。

07:27.689 --> 07:29.551
Guess who we saw outside?
猜猜我们在外面看到了谁？

07:29.620 --> 07:30.931
Elmer Eraser!
埃尔默橡皮擦！

07:31.034 --> 07:31.896
What?!
什么？！

07:32.000 --> 07:33.448
Oh, I'm doomed!
哦，我注定了！

07:33.551 --> 07:37.448
Don't worry. We'll put you into
witness protection protection.
不用担心。我们会把你放入
证人保护保护。

07:37.551 --> 07:39.586
You're safe with us.
和我们在一起你很安全。

07:39.689 --> 07:41.275
-Whoa!
-[glass shatters]
-哇！
-[玻璃碎裂]

07:41.758 --> 07:44.172
Here's a hideout
with a lot of natural light.
这里是一个藏身处
拥有充足的自然光。

07:44.275 --> 07:45.965
-[thud]
-[Squidward grunts]
-[砰]
-[章鱼哥咕哝]

07:46.068 --> 07:47.448
-[upbeat music playing]
-[door slams]
-[欢快的音乐播放]
-[关门声]

07:47.586 --> 07:49.862
A glass house? Are you nuts?
玻璃房子？你疯了吗？

07:49.931 --> 07:52.862
This way, you can see
Elmer Eraser coming.
这样你就可以看到
埃尔默橡皮擦来了。

07:52.965 --> 07:55.310
But he can see me too.
但他也能看到我。

07:55.689 --> 07:56.793
You!
你！

07:56.896 --> 07:58.620
You guys lied to me.
你们对我撒谎了。

07:58.724 --> 08:00.172
That's Squidward!
那是章鱼哥！

08:00.689 --> 08:01.862
[screaming]
[尖叫]

08:02.000 --> 08:04.068
Don't worry. I got him.
不用担心。我抓住了他。

08:04.172 --> 08:05.379
-Wait! Don't!
-[grunts]
-等待！不！
-[咕哝]

08:05.517 --> 08:07.379
-[thump]
-[crumbling]
-[重击]
-[崩溃]

08:08.103 --> 08:09.275
Oh!
哦！

08:09.379 --> 08:11.862
It's a plexiglass house.
这是一座有机玻璃房子。

08:12.000 --> 08:14.000
[both panting anxiously]
[两人都焦急地喘着气]

08:15.241 --> 08:16.172
[clinking]
[叮叮当当]

08:16.758 --> 08:17.482
Perfect!
完美的！

08:17.620 --> 08:19.655
We can drive far, far away.
我们可以开车去很远很远的地方。

08:20.241 --> 08:22.482
[engine starts, revs]
[发动机启动，转速]

08:23.000 --> 08:23.827
[clanking]
[叮当声]

08:23.931 --> 08:25.172
Gotcha!
明白了！

08:26.034 --> 08:28.000
Everybody jump!
大家跳起来吧！

08:29.034 --> 08:29.965
[all grunt]
[全都咕哝]

08:30.068 --> 08:32.793
This is how you make a getaway.
这就是你逃跑的方式。

08:32.862 --> 08:34.137
-[engine revs]
-Wait.
-[发动机转速]
-等等。

08:34.241 --> 08:35.793
-[all screaming]
-[thud]
-[全都尖叫]
-[砰]

08:35.862 --> 08:38.310
[comical music plays]
[滑稽的音乐响起]

08:38.379 --> 08:42.931
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

08:43.034 --> 08:44.379
Quick! In there!
快的！在那里！

08:44.482 --> 08:45.620
[upbeat music plays]
[欢快的音乐响起]

08:45.689 --> 08:47.551
[thud, pop]
[砰砰声，砰砰声]

08:47.655 --> 08:49.517
[thudding]
[重击]

08:50.000 --> 08:50.827
[eraser squeaking]
[橡皮擦的吱吱声]

08:50.931 --> 08:52.310
[all whimpering]
[全都呜咽]

08:52.689 --> 08:53.724
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

08:55.413 --> 08:56.655
[all groaning]
[全都呻吟]

08:57.172 --> 08:58.137
Up there!
上面！

08:58.206 --> 09:00.000
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

09:00.103 --> 09:02.206
[grumbles, grunts]
[抱怨声，咕哝声]

09:03.655 --> 09:07.379
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

09:07.482 --> 09:08.827
[thud]
[砰]

09:08.931 --> 09:12.137
[upbeat music continues]
[欢快的音乐继续]

09:14.344 --> 09:15.413
[door closes]
[门关上]

09:15.517 --> 09:17.275
[SpongeBob] You'll be safe
in here.
[海绵宝宝] 你会安全的
在这里。

09:17.379 --> 09:19.931
[growling]
[咆哮]

09:21.310 --> 09:22.103
Gotcha!
明白了！

09:22.241 --> 09:23.793
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:25.586 --> 09:27.344
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:27.896 --> 09:29.620
-[door slams open]
-[grunts]
-[门猛地打开]
-[咕哝]

09:31.034 --> 09:33.689
Squidward is unprotected.
章鱼哥没有受到保护。

09:33.758 --> 09:35.034
Hop on!
跳上来！

09:36.896 --> 09:39.034
[upbeat music continues]
[欢快的音乐继续]

09:41.275 --> 09:42.689
-[horn honks]
-Huh?
-[喇叭鸣响]
-啊？

09:43.241 --> 09:45.448
[together] We'll save you,
Squidward!
[一起]我们会拯救你，
章鱼哥！

09:45.896 --> 09:46.965
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:47.379 --> 09:49.000
[screaming]
[尖叫]

09:49.724 --> 09:51.034
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

09:55.172 --> 09:56.206
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:56.655 --> 09:58.206
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:58.551 --> 09:59.724
Oh, no!
哦，不！

09:59.862 --> 10:02.827
Those two halfwits found me.
那两个笨蛋找到了我。

10:05.241 --> 10:06.310
[laughs]
[笑]

10:06.896 --> 10:09.965
Phew! It's just Elmer Eraser.
唷！这只是埃尔默橡皮擦。

10:10.827 --> 10:12.724
Elmer Eraser!
埃尔默橡皮擦！

10:12.827 --> 10:14.655
[SpongeBob and Patrick
screaming]
[海绵宝宝和帕特里克
尖叫]

10:15.068 --> 10:16.965
We'll protect you, Squidward.
我们会保护你，章鱼哥。

10:17.068 --> 10:18.586
-[Elmer Eraser] Gotcha!
-[exclaims]
-[埃尔默橡皮擦]明白了！
-[惊呼]

10:18.689 --> 10:22.551
Please, Elmer Eraser,
don't rub out Squidward.
拜托，埃尔默橡皮擦，
别抹掉章鱼哥。

10:23.275 --> 10:24.689
Aw, don't worry.
噢，别担心。

10:24.758 --> 10:26.034
I'm not Elmer.
我不是埃尔默。

10:26.103 --> 10:27.931
I'm Detective Eraser.
我是橡皮侦探。

10:29.034 --> 10:31.413
[whimpers woozily]
[迷迷糊糊地呜咽]

10:31.896 --> 10:33.586
Elmer's my twin brother.
埃尔默是我的双胞胎兄弟。

10:33.689 --> 10:35.758
I've been trying to find you
all day.
我一直在努力寻找你
一整天。

10:35.896 --> 10:37.586
Oh, thank goodness.
哦，谢天谢地。

10:37.689 --> 10:39.758
Can you arrest
these two blockheads
你能逮捕吗
这两个笨蛋

10:39.862 --> 10:42.344
so I can go back
to being John Dolphin?
这样我就可以回去
成为约翰·海豚？

10:42.448 --> 10:46.413
Lucky for you, my brother Elmer
has been caught and put in jail.
你很幸运，我的兄弟埃尔默
已被抓获并投入监狱。

10:46.517 --> 10:49.275
You don't need
witness protection anymore.
你不需要
不再有证人保护了。

10:50.068 --> 10:52.448
[Squidward grunting]
[章鱼哥咕哝]

10:52.931 --> 10:53.827
Ouch.
哎哟。

10:54.241 --> 10:55.931
Isn't it great, Squidward?
不是很棒吗，章鱼哥？

10:56.034 --> 10:59.068
You can come back
to Bikini Bottom with us.
你可以回来
和我们一起去比基尼泳裤。

10:59.172 --> 11:01.620
-Squidward's back!
-Yay!
-章鱼哥回来了！
-耶！

11:01.689 --> 11:04.310
-Wonderful.
-Squidward's back!
-精彩的。
-章鱼哥回来了！

11:04.448 --> 11:05.413
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

11:05.517 --> 11:06.586
[jaunty music playing]
[欢快的音乐]

11:06.689 --> 11:08.413
-You're it.
-No, you're it.
-就是你了。
-不，你就是了。

11:08.517 --> 11:09.448
No, you're it.
不，你就是了。

11:09.551 --> 11:10.689
-Squidward's it.
-No, you're it.
-章鱼哥就是它。
-不，你就是了。

11:10.827 --> 11:13.068
[Squidward, VO]
I was finally safe,
[章鱼哥，画外音]
我终于安全了

11:13.172 --> 11:17.517
but I was about to become
witness to another crime,
但我即将成为
目睹另一起犯罪行为，

11:17.620 --> 11:20.793
a crime I was going to commit.
我即将犯下的罪行。

11:20.896 --> 11:24.000
I'm going to rub you out!
我要把你擦掉！

11:24.379 --> 11:27.413
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

11:27.517 --> 11:28.896
[laughing maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

11:29.655 --> 11:31.482
Rub. Rub. Rub.
擦。擦。擦。

11:31.620 --> 11:34.965
[laughing maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

11:35.103 --> 11:37.655
[surf rock music playing]
[冲浪摇滚音乐播放]

11:44.586 --> 11:45.586
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

11:45.655 --> 11:46.793
[bluegrass music playing]
[蓝草音乐演奏]

11:46.931 --> 11:49.586
Boy, that was one heck
of a shoppin' spree
男孩，那真是太糟糕了
疯狂购物

11:49.655 --> 11:51.689
down at the old Nut Barn.
在老坚果谷仓。

11:52.137 --> 11:53.586
[sucking]
[吸吮]

11:55.000 --> 11:56.137
Ah.
啊。

11:56.965 --> 11:59.000
[crunches, gulps]
Worth it, though.
[仰卧起坐，吞咽]
不过还是值得的。

11:59.137 --> 12:00.172
[crunching]
[嘎吱嘎吱]

12:00.275 --> 12:02.206
These cracklin' nuts
taste so good,
这些坚果
味道真好，

12:02.344 --> 12:04.862
it's like there's a hootenanny
in my mouth.
就好像有一个胡特纳尼
在我嘴里。

12:04.965 --> 12:05.862
Bleh!
哎呀！

12:05.965 --> 12:08.689
Yeehaw!
耶哈！

12:08.827 --> 12:11.241
-[crunching]
-[acorns screaming]
-[嘎吱嘎吱]
-[橡子尖叫]

12:11.344 --> 12:12.827
-[thud]
-[grunts]
-[砰]
-[咕哝]

12:12.896 --> 12:15.482
[groaning]
Where'd that come fr--
[呻吟]
那是从哪里来的——

12:15.551 --> 12:16.724
-[gasps]
-[cracking]
-[喘气]
-[破裂]

12:16.862 --> 12:19.965
Oh, my helmet's about to crack
like an egg.
哦，我的头盔快要裂了
像鸡蛋一样。

12:20.068 --> 12:22.931
I gotta get home
to my dome ASAP.
我得回家了
尽快到我的圆顶。

12:23.827 --> 12:24.655
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

12:24.758 --> 12:25.965
-[grunts]
-[glass shatters]
-[咕哝]
-[玻璃碎裂]

12:26.034 --> 12:28.310
[gasping]
[喘气]

12:28.413 --> 12:30.275
That was a close shave.
那是一次险胜。

12:30.379 --> 12:32.344
Better dig out my backup helmet.
最好把我的备用头盔挖出来。

12:32.862 --> 12:33.965
[whirring]
[呼呼]

12:34.068 --> 12:35.034
Aha!
啊哈！

12:35.137 --> 12:36.275
[shattering]
[破碎]

12:36.379 --> 12:39.482
Whoops! Must be
all that nut dust on my fingers.
哎呀！必须是
我手指上沾满了坚果粉。

12:39.551 --> 12:42.172
Looks like I'm plumb out
of helmets.
看起来我已经铅垂了
的头盔。

12:42.275 --> 12:43.827
Better order a new one.
最好订购一件新的。

12:43.931 --> 12:45.068
[upbeat music playing]
[欢快的音乐播放]

12:45.172 --> 12:47.655
-[dialing]
-[line connects]
-[拨号]
-[线路连接]

12:47.724 --> 12:49.620
Hello? Helmets Direct?
你好？直接戴头盔？

12:49.689 --> 12:51.206
Yeah, I need another one.
是的，我需要另一份。

12:51.310 --> 12:55.172
-[man] What size do you need?
-Size? Size? Squirrel medium.
-[男士]您需要什么尺寸？
-尺寸？尺寸？松鼠中等。

12:55.241 --> 12:56.896
-We're out of size medium.
-Uh-huh.
- 我们的中号尺码不够了。
-呃哈。

12:57.000 --> 12:58.517
-I'll have to special order it.
-Uh-huh.
-我必须特别订购。
-呃哈。

12:58.620 --> 13:00.517
It's gonna take six
to eight weeks to get it.
需要六个
八周才能得到它。

13:00.586 --> 13:02.482
Six to eight weeks?
六到八周？

13:02.620 --> 13:05.862
[sighs] Looks like
I'm stuck inside for a while.
[叹气]看起来像
我被困在里面一段时间了。

13:05.965 --> 13:07.965
But I got plenty to do.
但我还有很多事要做。

13:08.068 --> 13:09.896
[upbeat country music playing]
[欢快的乡村音乐演奏]

13:10.000 --> 13:11.310
[bell rings]
[铃声响起]

13:11.965 --> 13:13.000
[blows landing]
[吹着陆]

13:16.206 --> 13:17.758
-[grunting]
-[keyboard clacking]
-[咕哝]
-[键盘咔哒声]

13:19.482 --> 13:20.793
[timer dings]
[计时器的声音]

13:20.896 --> 13:22.586
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

13:23.310 --> 13:27.275
[chittering]
[叽叽喳喳]

13:27.379 --> 13:29.379
[music continues]
[音乐继续]

13:33.413 --> 13:35.241
[chirping]
[叽叽喳喳]

13:35.310 --> 13:36.689
[music slows, distorts]
[音乐变慢、扭曲]

13:36.793 --> 13:39.896
[off-key notes]
[走调笔记]

13:39.965 --> 13:42.103
[music slows and distorts]
[音乐变慢并扭曲]

13:46.172 --> 13:47.241
-[music ends]
-[thud]
-[音乐结束]
-[砰]

13:47.310 --> 13:49.931
It's only been one hour,
才过了一个小时，

13:50.068 --> 13:52.793
but I can't take it anymore.
但我再也受不了了。

13:52.896 --> 13:55.931
If I don't see
another living critter soon,
如果我没有看到
很快又一个活生生的动物，

13:56.068 --> 13:58.448
I'm gonna go nuts.
我要发疯了。

13:59.586 --> 14:01.965
-Nuts. [chuckles]
-[rim shot]
-坚果。 [笑声]
-[边缘射击]

14:02.068 --> 14:03.517
[acorn] Hey, now, Sandy.
[橡子]嘿，现在，桑迪。

14:03.655 --> 14:05.000
You'd never go nuts.
你永远不会发疯。

14:05.103 --> 14:08.517
Your grip on reality
is too firm.
你对现实的把握
太坚定了。

14:09.000 --> 14:10.827
Thanks, Nutty Buddy.
谢谢，坚果好友。

14:10.931 --> 14:12.965
You're always here for me.
你总是在我身边。

14:13.034 --> 14:14.896
[Nutty Buddy] That's what
friends are for.
[臭小子] 就是这样
朋友是为了。

14:15.000 --> 14:17.862
Maybe I can lasso someone
into coming over.
也许我可以套住某人
过来。

14:17.965 --> 14:20.206
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

14:20.344 --> 14:22.896
-[busy signal beeping]
-[French Narrator reading]
-[忙音提示音]
-[法语旁白朗读]

14:23.000 --> 14:24.620
I don't understand.
我不明白。

14:24.689 --> 14:28.793
How can everyone be busy
at 2:30 on a Tuesday?
怎么大家都忙起来
周二 2:30？

14:29.896 --> 14:31.931
Oh, I know!
哦，我知道！

14:32.034 --> 14:34.517
If I can't get my friends
to visit me,
如果我联系不到我的朋友
来拜访我，

14:34.620 --> 14:36.068
I'll visit them...
我去拜访他们...

14:36.172 --> 14:37.793
remotely.
远程。

14:37.896 --> 14:41.068
-[whirring]
-[adventurous music playing]
-[呼呼]
-[冒险音乐播放]

14:41.172 --> 14:43.827
-[whirring]
-[adventurous music continues]
-[呼呼]
-[冒险音乐继续]

14:53.655 --> 14:54.758
[snoring]
[打鼾]

14:54.862 --> 14:56.689
[sighs] You got this.
[叹气]你明白了。

14:56.793 --> 14:59.000
[whimpering nervously]
You got it.
[紧张地呜咽]
你明白了。

14:59.068 --> 15:02.896
Well, that's about as exciting
as riding a no-legged bull.
嗯，这同样令人兴奋
就像骑一头无腿的公牛一样。

15:03.034 --> 15:04.758
Next!
下一个！

15:04.862 --> 15:06.103
[snoring]
[打鼾]

15:06.241 --> 15:07.620
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

15:07.724 --> 15:09.379
[crashing]
[崩溃]

15:10.379 --> 15:11.448
Very good.
非常好。

15:11.586 --> 15:14.379
Now, let's try parallel parking.
现在，让我们尝试平行停车。

15:14.482 --> 15:17.586
[yawns]
[哈欠]

15:17.724 --> 15:18.586
[grumbles]
[抱怨]

15:18.724 --> 15:19.517
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

15:19.586 --> 15:21.310
[surf rock music playing]
[冲浪摇滚音乐播放]

15:23.827 --> 15:26.758
-And... done.
-[ding]
-然后...完成了。
-[叮]

15:26.896 --> 15:29.137
Now, for 10,000 with this arm.
现在，用这只手臂换一万个。

15:29.517 --> 15:32.379
-One... [grunts]
-[ding]
-一个...[咕哝]
-[叮]

15:32.517 --> 15:33.827
Two...
二...

15:33.896 --> 15:35.310
-[ding]
-[grunts]
-[叮]
-[咕哝]

15:35.724 --> 15:38.586
-Three...
-[Sandy snoring]
-三...
-[桑迪打鼾]

15:38.689 --> 15:41.758
[grunts] This is making
my eyelids feel heavier
[咕噜声]这是在做
我的眼皮感觉更重

15:41.896 --> 15:43.379
than Larry's weights.
比拉里的体重。

15:43.758 --> 15:44.793
Next!
下一个！

15:45.448 --> 15:46.862
-[grunting]
-[bonk]
-[咕哝]
-[棒棒哒]

15:48.241 --> 15:49.482
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

15:50.241 --> 15:54.000
-[flying camera whirring]
-[upbeat music playing]
-[飞行相机呼呼]
-[欢快的音乐播放]

15:54.068 --> 15:55.931
-And done.
-[cash register dings]
-完成了。
-[收银机叮叮声]

15:56.034 --> 15:59.689
Phew! Now for 10,000
with this arm.
唷！现在10,000
用这只手臂。

16:00.103 --> 16:02.655
-One...
-[cash register dings]
-一个...
-[收银机叮叮声]

16:03.000 --> 16:04.827
-Two...
-[cash register dings]
-两个...
-[收银机叮叮声]

16:05.965 --> 16:08.068
-Three...
-[cash register dings]
-三...
-[收银机叮叮声]

16:08.172 --> 16:09.896
[Sandy grumbles]
[桑迪抱怨]

16:10.000 --> 16:11.310
[Mr. Krabs] Four...
[先生。蟹]四...

16:11.413 --> 16:13.551
Yeesh! Gah!
是啊！嘎！

16:14.241 --> 16:15.896
Five...
五...

16:17.241 --> 16:18.862
[gasps]
[喘气]

16:19.000 --> 16:20.965
[Sandy] There's gotta be
something interesting
[桑迪] 一定有
一些有趣的事情

16:21.068 --> 16:23.172
-to look at in this town.
-[thud]
-在这个小镇上看看。
-[砰]

16:23.275 --> 16:24.793
-[static crackles]
-Huh?
-[静态爆裂声]
-啊？

16:24.896 --> 16:26.551
What in the...?
什么在...？

16:26.620 --> 16:28.000
Of course!
当然！

16:28.137 --> 16:30.931
That big old metal whatsit
I ran into.
那个又大又旧的金属是什么东西
我碰到了。

16:31.275 --> 16:32.586
Plankton?
浮游生物？

16:32.655 --> 16:35.172
Better go in for a closer look.
最好进去仔细看看。

16:35.275 --> 16:37.103
-[Plankton whistling]
-[whirring]
-[浮游生物的呼啸声]
-[呼呼]

16:37.206 --> 16:39.310
Huh? What's that noise?
啊？那是什么声音？

16:39.448 --> 16:42.931
[sighs] Did I leave Karen on
all night again?
[叹气]我有没有留下凯伦
又整夜了？

16:44.448 --> 16:45.517
[screams]
[尖叫声]

16:46.482 --> 16:47.827
[grunts]
[咕哝]

16:47.931 --> 16:49.137
[whirring rapidly]
[快速呼呼]

16:49.241 --> 16:52.931
Whoa. Mosquitos sure are
getting big this year.
哇哦。蚊子肯定有
今年变大了。

16:53.310 --> 16:54.689
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

16:54.793 --> 16:57.344
[whirring, clanking]
[呼呼声、叮当声]

16:57.448 --> 16:58.931
Dang that Plankton!
该死的浮游生物！

16:59.000 --> 17:02.068
Now I gottafigure out
what he's up to.
现在我得弄清楚
他在做什么。

17:02.172 --> 17:03.206
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

17:03.344 --> 17:06.034
-[phone ringing]
-[SpongeBob] Yello?
-[电话铃声]
-[海绵宝宝] 你好？

17:06.137 --> 17:07.517
Heya, SpongeBob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

17:07.586 --> 17:09.896
I'm in the middle
of an investigation,
我在中间
的一项调查，

17:10.000 --> 17:13.413
and I was hoping you could do
a little reconnoitering for me.
我希望你能做到
对我来说有点侦察。

17:14.517 --> 17:16.827
-[blade swishes]
-Hyah! Gosh, Sandy, I'd love to,
-[刀锋嗖嗖]
-哈！天哪，桑迪，我很乐意，

17:16.931 --> 17:20.034
but I'm already reconnoitering
a new mustard mine
但我已经在侦察了
一个新的芥末矿

17:20.172 --> 17:21.137
for Mr. Krabs.
给蟹老板的。

17:21.206 --> 17:24.689
[sinister growling]
[险恶的咆哮]

17:24.793 --> 17:27.379
-[growling, shrieking]
-[screaming]
-[咆哮，尖叫]
-[尖叫]

17:27.482 --> 17:30.241
-[gorilla grunting]
-[SpongeBob screaming]
-[大猩猩咕哝]
-[海绵宝宝尖叫]

17:30.344 --> 17:32.551
I get it. I get it. You're busy.
我得到它。我得到它。你很忙。

17:32.655 --> 17:34.586
You don't have to holler
about it.
你不必大喊大叫
关于它。

17:35.827 --> 17:36.655
[dialing]
[拨号]

17:36.724 --> 17:39.724
-[phone ringing]
-Uh...
-[电话铃声]
-呃...

17:39.862 --> 17:41.517
-[ringing continues]
-Huh?
-[铃声继续]
-啊？

17:43.068 --> 17:44.827
-Hello?
-[Sandy] Howdy, Patrick.
-你好？
-[桑迪]你好，帕特里克。

17:44.931 --> 17:47.517
I'm trying to peep
Plankton's plans.
我正试图偷看
浮游生物的计划。

17:47.620 --> 17:48.689
Wanna help out?
想帮忙吗？

17:48.827 --> 17:50.551
Sure. I'll be over
当然。我会结束的

17:50.655 --> 17:53.413
as soon as I finish my sandwich.
我一吃完三明治。

17:54.275 --> 17:56.344
Okay. [murmurs]
好的。 [低语]

17:56.482 --> 17:57.379
[chomps]
[咀嚼]

17:57.482 --> 17:58.724
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

17:58.827 --> 18:01.482
All right, Patrick.
This should be simple enough.
好吧，帕特里克。
这应该很简单。

18:02.103 --> 18:04.551
Plankton is building
some sort of evil device.
浮游生物正在建造
某种邪恶的装置。

18:04.655 --> 18:07.482
All you gotta do is head
over there with my camera
你所要做的就是头
带着我的相机在那边

18:07.620 --> 18:09.310
and give it a look 'fer. Roger?
并看看它。罗杰？

18:09.448 --> 18:11.758
A look 'fer. Roger!
一看。罗杰！

18:11.862 --> 18:13.931
[adventurous music playing]
[冒险的音乐演奏]

18:17.000 --> 18:20.137
[low whirring]
[低呼呼声]

18:20.241 --> 18:21.586
[Sandy] Whatcha...
[桑迪] 啥……

18:22.172 --> 18:24.413
doin' there, Patrick?
帕特里克，在那儿做什么？

18:24.517 --> 18:27.310
Looking for Roger.
寻找罗杰.

18:27.448 --> 18:29.931
[Sandy sighs] Let me give you
a little help.
[桑迪叹气]让我给你
一点帮助。

18:31.241 --> 18:36.413
[exclaiming, spluttering]
[惊呼，溅水]

18:36.551 --> 18:37.620
[thud]
[砰]

18:41.896 --> 18:45.931
Karen, I'm going out
for coffee and crullers.
凯伦，我要出去
咖啡和油条。

18:46.586 --> 18:49.896
[Sandy] Perfect! Snoop around
while Plankton's gone.
[桑迪] 完美！窥探周围
当浮游生物消失时。

18:49.965 --> 18:52.620
Oh, boy! I love snooping.
哦，孩子！我喜欢窥探。

18:52.724 --> 18:56.034
♪ Snoop, snoop, snooper snoop,
snoopy snoop ♪
♪ 窥探，窥探，窥探，窥探，
史努比史努比♪

18:56.103 --> 18:57.620
Keep your eyes peeled for a clue
睁大眼睛寻找线索

18:57.724 --> 18:59.586
that might tell us
what he's up to.
这可能会告诉我们
他在做什么。

18:59.689 --> 19:02.172
Blueprints, memory cards,
microfiche...
蓝图、存储卡、
缩微胶片...

19:02.310 --> 19:03.655
[Patrick]
Ooh, I found something!
[帕特里克]
哦，我发现了一些东西！

19:03.758 --> 19:05.655
-Is it a clue?
-Yeah!
-这是一个线索吗？
-是的！

19:06.068 --> 19:08.137
A delicious one.
美味的一个。

19:08.206 --> 19:10.206
It's his lunch.
这是他的午餐。

19:11.310 --> 19:12.655
[Patrick giggles]
[帕特里克咯咯笑]

19:12.758 --> 19:14.965
[munching] Mmm!
[咀嚼]嗯！

19:15.068 --> 19:18.034
Patrick, that ain't a clue.
That's a tiny burrito.
帕特里克，这不是线索。
这是一个小墨西哥卷饼。

19:18.172 --> 19:20.206
[Patrick] Okay, okay.
[帕特里克] 好吧，好吧。

19:20.310 --> 19:21.758
[burrito whistles through air]
[墨西哥卷饼在空中吹口哨]

19:21.862 --> 19:23.862
[Patrick munches, gulps]
[帕特里克咀嚼，吞咽]

19:24.793 --> 19:27.482
Here, Roger, Roger.
在这里，罗杰，罗杰。

19:28.448 --> 19:30.482
Ugh, there's nothing here.
呃，这里什么都没有。

19:30.620 --> 19:33.275
Just this dumb old box of...
只是这个愚蠢的旧盒子......

19:33.655 --> 19:38.034
"puh-loo-toe-ni-um!" Who cares?
“噗-卢-托-尼-嗯！”谁在乎？

19:38.689 --> 19:40.379
Plutonium?! [exclaims]
钚？！ [惊呼]

19:40.482 --> 19:43.517
Plankton must be building
some sort of atomic weapon!
浮游生物一定正在建造
某种原子武器！

19:43.965 --> 19:47.896
[gasping] And it's pointed
right at the Krusty Krab!
[喘气]而且它是尖的
就在蟹堡王那里！

19:48.000 --> 19:49.965
All right, Patrick,
you've done your part.
好吧，帕特里克，
你已经尽了你的职责。

19:50.034 --> 19:53.379
These glow sticks
make my bones itchy.
这些荧光棒
让我的骨头发痒。

19:53.517 --> 19:56.068
Now I'm gonna zap him
with my laser.
现在我要消灭他
用我的激光。

19:56.827 --> 19:58.862
-She's warming up now.
-[laser beeping]
-她现在正在热身。
-[激光蜂鸣声]

19:58.965 --> 20:00.551
[Plankton]
♪ Do, do, do, dee... ♪
[浮游生物]
♪ 做，做，做，迪……♪

20:00.689 --> 20:02.931
[Sandy] Oh, no! Plankton's back.
[桑迪]哦，不！浮游生物回来了。

20:03.034 --> 20:04.827
Patrick, you gotta get
outta there.
帕特里克，你必须得到
离开那里。

20:04.931 --> 20:06.482
-Don't let him see you!
-[munching]
-别让他看到你！
-[咀嚼]

20:06.620 --> 20:07.793
-Hurry!
-Huh.
-匆忙！
-嗯。

20:07.862 --> 20:10.551
I am like unto the wind.
我就像风一样。

20:10.655 --> 20:12.206
[Japanese string music plays]
[日本弦乐演奏]

20:12.344 --> 20:15.517
Whoa! [gasping]
哇！ [喘气]

20:15.655 --> 20:18.827
Hey! [gasping] Whoa!
嘿！ [喘气]哇！

20:18.931 --> 20:19.862
[grunts]
[咕哝]

20:20.206 --> 20:22.000
[comedic musical sting]
[喜剧音乐刺]

20:22.448 --> 20:23.413
[slurping]
[发出声音]

20:23.517 --> 20:25.482
What are you doing here, bozo?
你在这里做什么，博佐？

20:25.586 --> 20:27.172
My name's Patrick,
我叫帕特里克

20:27.310 --> 20:28.241
not Bozo.
不是博佐。

20:29.068 --> 20:30.724
Yeah, no duh, Sherlock.
是的，不，夏洛克。

20:30.827 --> 20:34.413
My name's Bozo, not Sherlock.
我的名字是博佐，不是夏洛克。

20:34.517 --> 20:35.620
[grumbling]
[抱怨]

20:35.689 --> 20:38.241
Oh, no! He's onto us.
哦，不！他来找我们了。

20:38.344 --> 20:41.344
Time to take out that weapon.
[grunts]
是时候拿出那件武器了。
[咕哝]

20:41.482 --> 20:43.000
[laser humming]
[激光嗡嗡声]

20:43.103 --> 20:45.689
I know your name, ding dong!
我知道你的名字，叮咚！

20:45.793 --> 20:49.172
My name's Sherlock,
not Ding Dong.
我的名字是夏洛克
不是丁东。

20:49.275 --> 20:51.482
Enough! It doesn't matter.
足够的！没关系。

20:51.586 --> 20:52.896
You're gonna be the first
你将成为第一个

20:53.034 --> 20:56.413
to witness
my latest evil invention.
见证
我最新的邪恶发明。

20:56.517 --> 20:58.793
[laughs maniacally]
[疯狂地笑]

20:58.896 --> 20:59.689
[grunts]
[咕哝]

20:59.793 --> 21:01.034
[rattling]
[嘎嘎声]

21:01.103 --> 21:02.896
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

21:02.965 --> 21:04.586
[upbeat music playing]
[欢快的音乐播放]

21:04.689 --> 21:07.448
"Eat at the Chum Bucket."
“在 Chum Bucket 吃。”

21:07.586 --> 21:10.724
It's just a dumb, old sign?
这只是一个愚蠢的、古老的标志吗？

21:10.827 --> 21:12.620
That's not evil.
那不是邪恶的。

21:13.103 --> 21:16.448
Well, the plutonium
wasn't sourced ethically,
嗯，钚
来源不符合道德规范，

21:16.586 --> 21:18.241
so it's a little evil.
所以有点邪恶。

21:18.344 --> 21:23.137
-[laser buzzing]
-[dramatic music playing]
-[激光嗡嗡声]
-[戏剧性音乐播放]

21:23.275 --> 21:24.448
[creaking]
[吱吱作响]

21:24.586 --> 21:26.793
Oh... boy.
哦...男孩。

21:26.931 --> 21:28.482
[creaking]
[吱吱作响]

21:28.931 --> 21:30.689
[crashing]
[崩溃]

21:30.793 --> 21:32.758
[surf rock music playing]
[冲浪摇滚音乐播放]

21:32.896 --> 21:33.827
Huh?
啊？

21:33.931 --> 21:35.931
Why didn't I think of that?
为什么我没有想到这一点？

21:36.068 --> 21:37.724
Eat that, Krabs!
吃那个吧，蟹蟹们！

21:37.793 --> 21:39.241
[laughs] Whoo!
[笑] 哇！

21:39.344 --> 21:42.068
-[surf rock music plays]
-[French Narrator reading]
-[冲浪摇滚音乐响起]
-[法语旁白朗读]

21:42.586 --> 21:43.931
Thanks for hosting me restaurant
谢谢你招待我的餐厅

21:44.034 --> 21:46.413
while the Krusty Krab
is being repaired...
而蟹堡王
正在修复中...

21:46.793 --> 21:50.827
and while SpongeBob's recovering
from his gorilla injuries.
当海绵宝宝康复时
从他的大猩猩受伤中。

21:51.206 --> 21:52.655
It's the least I could do.
这是我至少能做的。

21:52.758 --> 21:54.310
-[doorbell rings]
-Huh?
-[门铃响了]
-啊？

21:54.931 --> 21:57.344
My helmet! Finally!
我的头盔！最后！

21:57.758 --> 21:59.310
[helmet shattering]
[头盔碎裂]

22:00.379 --> 22:04.206
Me new restaurant! Finally!
我的新餐厅！最后！

22:04.310 --> 22:06.000
Quit yer loafin', Mr. Squidward.
别再游手好闲了，章鱼哥先生。

22:06.103 --> 22:08.344
Ya got a buildin' to move.
你有一栋大楼要搬。

22:08.689 --> 22:10.862
[squelching]
[压抑]

22:10.965 --> 22:16.413
[sighs] Six to eight more weeks
on the inside?
[叹气]还有六到八周
在里面？

22:16.482 --> 22:17.482
[laughs]
[笑]

22:18.000 --> 22:21.137
[unhinged laughter]
[失控的笑声]

22:21.241 --> 22:24.724
How-how about you take
the next shift, Nutty Buddy?
怎么样，你拿怎么样
下一个班次，疯子巴迪？

22:24.827 --> 22:27.310
[unhinged laughter]
[失控的笑声]

22:28.896 --> 22:32.137
[Nutty Buddy] Man, I gotta make
some new friends.
[坚果好友] 伙计，我得做
一些新朋友。

22:32.310 --> 22:34.862
[closing theme playing]
【结束主题曲播放】

【结束主题曲播放】